    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Code Audit Sprint\r\n\r\n1. **Prompt**: Open the **AI Tutor** tab and ask: \"Review this code for accessibility issues. Suggest 2–3 improvements.\"\r\n2. **Analyze**: Read the suggestions.\r\n   * If AI suggests changing `div` tags to headings (like `h3`), look at **index.html**.\r\n   * If AI suggests adding `alt` text or clearer buttons, look at **script.js**.\r\n3. **Integrate**: Choose **one** major suggestion to fix.\r\n   * *Example:* In `script.js`, update `img.alt` to use the course title, or change `btn.innerText` to be more specific.\r\n4. **Reflect**: In `reflection.md`, record your answers to the following:\r\n\t- What did AI suggest?\r\n\t- Did we accept or reject it?\r\n\t- Why?",
